    {
      "title": "Letter of Application (Cover Letter)",
      "teacher": "Here is the one that will change your life first. A recruiter spends seconds deciding whether to open your resume — and your application letter is what makes that decision. Let's write one you can reuse for every job you apply to.",
      "explain": "A <strong>letter of application</strong> (also called a cover letter) is the formal letter you send along with your resume when applying for a job. Its job is not to repeat the resume — it is to <strong>connect your strengths to that particular job</strong> and persuade the reader to open the resume.",
      "keyPoints": [
        "It is always sent <strong>with</strong> a resume, never instead of it.",
