        "Subject line must name the <strong>exact post</strong> and reference number.",
        "<strong>Para 1:</strong> what post, where you saw it, and one line on why you fit.",
        "<strong>Para 2:</strong> your qualification and the skills that match <em>this</em> job.",
        "<strong>Para 3:</strong> projects/internships as evidence, and what you can give the company.",
        "<strong>Para 4:</strong> request an interview, thank them, mention the enclosed resume.",
        "Two types: <strong>solicited</strong> (in reply to an advertisement) and <strong>unsolicited</strong> (sent speculatively).",
        "Tailor it to every company — never send the same letter everywhere."
