      "explain": "An <strong>email</strong> is an electronic message sent over a network. In business it has largely replaced the printed letter, but it keeps the same expectations of clarity and courtesy. Its speed is its strength and also its danger — a careless email travels just as fast as a careful one.",
      "keyPoints": [
        "<strong>Advantages:</strong> fast, nearly free, works across the world, keeps a searchable record.",
        "Can attach files and reach many people at once with one click.",
