        "<strong>Limitations:</strong> no tone — short replies easily read as rude.",
        "Needs internet and a device; not everyone checks email regularly.",
        "Spam, phishing, viruses and hacking are real security risks.",
        "Cannot be recalled once sent; informal emails may lack legal weight.",
        "Overload — an important mail gets buried among fifty unimportant ones.",
